s=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620410/extras/c3cf9ead8264ac76fdc60838a2bbca88.avif?t=1716052134\" /></div><br><strong><i>'Nano\u2019</i></strong>, <strong><i>\u2018Bio\u2019</i></strong>, <strong><i>\u2018Neuro\u2019</i></strong>, the slogans of the new age! Welcome to the world of living technologies: a world in which computers can be fed and cured, where insect hormones revitalize memory, biofactories exist that give birth to household utensils, and genetically-modified molds can generate virtual realities! However, this bizarre idyll is disrupted by a mysterious epidemic\u2026<br><br>The implantation of neural networks into the brain served humanity for good, helping people sort information, clean their thoughts, and filter out odors and tastes. But some considered the experiment dangerous\u2014what if instead of adjusting to an individual, it would rewrite them? Neural networks gathered data, learning from within about the weaknesses of their carriers, and optimized themselves. Then suddenly, an explosion! The Worm epidemic subjugated humanity to their neural networks, and took control. Now there are whole \u201cworm\u201d cities, whose inhabitants are busy with sinister rituals and searching for new victims.<br><br>Having entered this brave new world, can you find the <strong>Exit</strong>?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620410/extras/3fa041d9b4d783eeb168ae0e4fad9966.avif?t=1716052134\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "In the world of excessive biotechnologies, an epidemic is ravaging the human race, infecting people's neuronet implants and enslaving them to the mysterious Worm. Who are you: a fighter of the infection, or a hunter of new prey?",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian",
    "reviews": "\u201cAnd suddenly dialogue options appear after playing a silent protagonist for most of the game, or a UI element falls down, or your normal organs are replaced by zodiac signs. This world isn't fully scientific, you see \u2014 in Exit, humans made tools from the four elements and chemistry is intertwined with Kabbalah\u201d<br>Alphyna<br><br>\u201cYou have to give the creators credit: they actually created a universe entirely made up of  slithy toves, \u0441olorless green ideas and zygotic roofs. It is very interesting to explore it...\u201d<br>Katabasia<br><br>\u201cRather than using these senses as a gimmick, smelling, listening, and tasting are very prominent actions as they can incite memories, unlock new items, and create a cavalcade of mythology, innovation, and the beautifully grotesque. In the first 20 minutes, you\u2019ll encounter an ouroboros and shoggoth!\u201d<br>Vulgar Knight<br>",
